== Overview ==
The '''Magnet Scientist Toilet''' is a [[Scientist Toilet]] but with more upgraded weapons. It has the second most health in the [[Time Factory]] Mode. It is exclusive on the og event
== Appearance ==
A [[Scientist Toilet]] with more weapons, some magnets around the arms with a machine gun hanging on its head. 
More information will be added soon after the update.
== Strategies ==
Use [[Camera Repair Drone]],[[Speaker Repair Drone]]or [[Medic Cameraman]] if needed, use high dps unit such as [[Astro Upgraded Titan Cameraman]] [[Hyper Upgraded Titan Speakerman]] to damage this unit.
== Trivia ==
